WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.472
- Let's say hello to
Vanna White everybody.

00:00:02.472 --> 00:00:05.038
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.150
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.070
- How are you?

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.670
- Oh my gosh! You just look so good,

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.060
still I'm angry about it,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.049
I'm so happy for you
is what I meant to say.

00:00:13.049 --> 00:00:14.580
(Vanna laughs)

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.040
Where are you? Hello!
Where are you at right now?

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.100
- I'm sitting in my dressing
room all dressed up for you.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.490
- Okay, I love it, I love it,
I like the shoes behind you.

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.620
So do you keep any favorite
things from the show?

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.630
- You know, I don't get to keep my dresses

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.990
but sometimes they let me
borrow them for things like this

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.210
or charity events and
things like that, so yeah,

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:37.090
it's kind of the best
of both worlds, right?

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.810
- Yes, it's so much smarter
to just borrow than buy

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.940
because you can only wear
it once anyway, generally,

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.240
I don't, I re-wear things, talk about it,

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.740
I don't care, talk about it.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.030
Yeah, I'm not wasting my
money, it's a nice black dress.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:50.020
Yeah, oh wait, so after all these years,

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.820
do you still love the excitement of it

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.950
especially when people like win big money

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:55.020
and it kind of changes their life,

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.240
does that still get to you?

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.360
- It's wonderful, we have so many winners,

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.640
they pay off their student
loans, they buy their first car,

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:07.850
they start a new business, so
there's so many great stories,

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:11.100
it's so great to see people
win and they win big.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.330
- They definitely do.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.240
Do you still remember any
of the big fails as well

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.160
when people thought they
were about to kill it

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.480
and they didn't?

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:22.340
- Yes, they are so nervous up there.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:25.370
One of the puzzles was more
fun than a barrel of monkeys,

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.130
they said more fun than
a barrel of Vikings.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:31.560
Another one was gone with the wind

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.600
and they said done with one hand.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:35.505
- No.

00:01:35.505 --> 00:01:36.653
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:36.653 --> 00:01:38.590
That's not how that goes.

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:42.610
- Oh, next, okay so before
the board was digital,

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:45.270
did you ever turn the wrong letter around?

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.570
'Cause that would have kind
of ruined everything.(laughs)

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.010
- One time I did it, I was mortified.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.430
I don't even remember which
was the correct puzzle,

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:56.280
it was either Dr. Spock or Mr. Spock

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.687
and I turned the M or
the D and it was like,

00:01:58.687 --> 00:02:01.500
"Oh that's the wrong letter, oh my gosh!"

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.730
So, I'm scarred for life on that.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:06.660
- Wait, what happens?

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.920
Do they have to like throw that one out?

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.730
- [Karen] Oh no!
- They did.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.850
They had to throw it out
and put another one in.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.650
- Yeah but one time in 40 years?

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.543
- I know I'm like one time only.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:22.390
- Fortunately in 1997 they
changed the puzzle board

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:26.480
where I only touch the
letters and when I touch them,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.150
I won't touch them unless they light up,

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:29.710
so the mistake will not be mine.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.543
- Oh.

00:02:30.543 --> 00:02:33.000
- Oh I love that, yeah, throw
someone else under that bus,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.110
that's what I'd do.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:36.630
So you're doing "Celebrity
Wheel Of Fortune" now,

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.650
so are famous people better or worse

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.360
than your usual contestants?
'Cause that was pretty funny,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.620
it took a minute to get
that L out, so...(laughs)

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.590
- They're definitely fun,
they have a great time

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:52.150
and I'm really surprised
at how good they really do.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.210
- Oh my gosh! I think I would
be nervous under the pressure

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.280
but girl, I'll love some Wheel
of Fortune slot machines.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.113
- I would do it.

00:02:57.113 --> 00:02:58.400
- Please tell me, wait, you would do it?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.233
- I would do it.

00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:01.233
- I would try but I would not
do well, probably nervous.

00:03:01.233 --> 00:03:02.066
- I love the Wheel of Fortune.

00:03:02.066 --> 00:03:03.370
- Yeah, I do love Wheel of Fortune,

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.070
wait, have you ever played,
please tell me you've played

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:08.160
Wheel of Fortune slot machines in Vegas.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.190
- Well, here's the thing, I have played it

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.360
but only for a minute
because what if I won,

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.760
that would be so weird,

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:17.200
so what I do...
- It would be awesome.

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:18.043
- It would be weird.

00:03:18.043 --> 00:03:19.260
- Let me tell you what I do.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.760
When I walk to the casino,

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.160
I walk up to a Wheel
of Fortune slot machine

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.500
and I'll rub the machine

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.130
or I'll tap the person on the
shoulder and say, "Good luck!"

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.620
- [Kelly] Oh my god!
- And keep on walking.

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:31.910
- Do they freak out?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:36.530
- And they're like, "What?
Wait, you're Vanna White, what?"

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.730
- Wait, you make this
promise to me right now ma'am

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.610
'cause I love playing slot machines

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.570
and I'm there often
enough when I do events,

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.270
so if you ever see me in
Vegas playing Wheel of Fortune

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.950
and you don't come up
to me and give me luck,

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.840
I will never talk to you again.(laughs)

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.220
- I promise I will.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.337
- Okay, I love the(mimicking beep sounds)

00:03:55.337 --> 00:03:56.420
(Karen laughs)

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.253
and now they've got the gold
spin Vanna, it's so much fun.

